# Allowlist, not a denylist: same rationale as claude/.gitignore.
#
# ~/.config/tuxedo is tree-folded into this directory, so everything tuxedo
# writes at runtime lands here. Ignore the lot, re-include only the
# configuration. config.toml itself is versioned, but its share_token and
# share_port lines are stripped on `git add` by the clean filter declared in
# the root .gitattributes (see tuxedo/CONTEXT.md).
.config/tuxedo/*
!.config/tuxedo/config.toml
